ed en brygge. " style="object-position:61% 45%" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div><div class="WZDjz9zYQgsPRbumUD_v"><span class="AwtpKg9okCi1XkA7NreX">Forskning</span><h3 class="qELDWCSeSJ1SDxUrtw0c">Hvor rik m&aring; man v&aelig;re for &aring; kalle seg rik?</h3><div class="kF4KqV8ac8a9rdoWGCg8">Reduser formueskatten! Norge trenger nemlig noe mer enn skattepenger fra Sveits-utflytterne.</div></div><a href="/kunnskap-kristiania/2026/9/hvor-rik-ma-man-vare-for-a-kalle-seg-rik/" class="PosterListRow__linkOverlay"><div class="visuallyHidden">Hvor rik m&aring; man v&aelig;re for &aring; kalle seg rik?</div></a></li><li class="LLzQvFszIj0jwBYa09Tw"><div class="SeJuexySANjxyiOM29ba"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL jUpUc0uR97EfldwPz00H"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 768px, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/contentassets/84bb162bd344404497cda3bfab067a6e/rene-ranisch-bylqnjbiros-unsplash.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/84bb162bd344404497cda3bfab067a6e/rene-ranisch-bylqnjbiros-unsplash.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/84bb162bd344404497cda3bfab067a6e/rene-ranisch-bylqnjbiros-unsplash.jpg?width=768 768w, /contentassets/84bb162bd344404497cda3bfab067a6e/rene-ranisch-bylqnjbiros-unsplash.jpg?width=1024 1024w"/><img src="/contentassets/84bb162bd344404497cda3bfab067a6e/rene-ranisch-bylqnjbiros-unsplash.jpg?width=500" alt="Mann med slips og kaffekopp ser ut av vinduet" style="object-position:60% 32%" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div><div class="WZDjz9zYQgsPRbumUD_v"><span class="AwtpKg9okCi1XkA7NreX">Forskning</span><h3 class="qELDWCSeSJ1SDxUrtw0c"><span data-contrast="none"><span>Hva skal lederne gj&oslash;re n&aring;r KI kan overta jobben?</span></span></h3><div class="kF4KqV8ac8a9rdoWGCg8">Skjemaer, rapporter og møter om møter: Dette kan KI snart ta over.</div></div><a href="/kunnskap-kristiania/2026/9/hva-skal-lederne-gjore-nar-ki-kan-overta-jobben/" class="PosterListRow__linkOverlay"><div class="visuallyHidden"><span data-contrast="none"><spa